==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{root|ru|ine-pro|*bʰer-}}
{{inh+|ru|orv|брѣмѧ}}, borrowed from {{der|ru|cu|брѣмѧ}}, from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*bermę||load, burden}}, from {{inh|ru|ine-pro|*bʰerH-men-}}. Compare the inherited doublet {{doublet|ru|бере́мя|notext=1}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|бре́мя}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-бремя.ogg}}
* {{rhymes|ru|emʲə|s=2}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|c|бре́мя|plhypall=*}}

# [[burden]], [[charge]], [[load]]
#: {{uxi|ru|[[большой|большо́е]] '''бре́мя''' [[для]] [[что|чего́]]|big '''burden''' for something}}

====Declension====
{{ru-noun-table|c|бре́мя|plhypall=*}}

